# Coolest Projects Monorepo

Event registration platform. Read `AGENTS.md` at repo root for full architecture.

## Layout

- `backend/` — npm workspaces: `apps/api` (NestJS), `apps/admin` (AdminJS), `packages/database` (Sequelize models)
- `frontend/` — Nuxt 3 registration SPA (Tailwind, Pinia, magic-link login)
- `configuration/` — Traefik TLS; do not modify certs unless asked
- `docker-compose.yml` — local dev stack; frontend at `app.coolestprojects.localhost:1234`

## Key rules

- Add/edit Sequelize models in `backend/packages/database/src/models/`, export from `index.ts`, register in `app.module.ts`
- Rebuild database package after model changes: `npm run build --workspace=@coolestprojects/database`
- Business logic belongs in `*.service.ts`; DTOs in `dto/`; controllers stay thin
- Active event context comes from `InfoInterceptor` — use `@Info()` decorator in controllers
- Use workspace flag for scripts: `npm run <script> -w @coolestprojects/api`
- Never commit `.env`, `dist/`, or `node_modules/`
- Voting app (`voting/`) is planned but not present in this repo yet
- Frontend API gaps documented in `frontend/MISSING_APIS.md`
